    "descriptionZh": "把任意颜色写法（字符串、color 对象、数字、TypedArray）统一转成通道数组，输出格式可选 uint8、float64、array 等。",
    "takeawayZh": "任意色值统一转成指定类型的通道数组",
    "noteZh": "README 首句写 Convert any color argument (string, color, number, object etc.) to an array with channels data of desired output format.，示例一行一个输出类型：rgba('red') 得 [1, 0, 0, 1]、rgba('rgb(80, 120, 160)', 'uint8') 得 Uint8Array<[80, 120, 160, 255]>、rgba('rgba(255, 255, 255, .5)', 'float64') 得 Float64Array<[1, 1, 1, .5]>、还有 uint8_clamped 与 array 两种。仓库 10 star、42 个 commit、1 branch，没有 release，Used by 20K，最近一次提交是 color-rgba 3.1: modern css strings (oklch, color()) normalize。",
